      "id": "F2",
      "status": "SOURCE_CONFIRMED_WITH_CMAKE_SEMANTICS_NO_NATIVE_CONFIGURE",
      "claim": "The compiled fmt target is declared by add_library(fmt src/format.cc ...) without an explicit STATIC/SHARED type; standard CMake BUILD_SHARED_LIBS selection therefore chooses static when false/unset and shared when true. setup_target creates alias fmt::fmt. FMT_OS defaults ON and adds src/os.cc; disabling it sets FMT_OS=0 privately. The shared branch supplies FMT_LIB_EXPORT privately and FMT_SHARED to consumers. No separate FMT_STATIC or FMT_SHARED CMake option is declared in the inspected root file.",
